e  degradation in the condition  from the wild type genes which actually  are  our control group here  and wild type signifies that  of a normal individual so we can clearly  see that these type of variations in the  alzheimer's  uh in the uh microglial cells can induce  alzheimer's disorder  easily and an early onset of it in all  the individuals  so  thank you for listening and these were  the main findings  of our project

